---
![велотренажер](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c005fa19-432e-405c-b146-8629890847cf)



{{% steps %}}

### Step 1
Sit on the bike and adjust the seat height to fit your height.

### Step 2
Select your workout program.
For a standard quick workout, you can simply start pedaling.

### Step 3
Hold the handlebars (gripping the pulse sensors) so your heart rate shows on the screen, and adjust your workout intensity as needed.

### Step 4
Возьмитесь за рукоятки тренажера так, чтобы вы смогли увидеть частоту сердечного ритма на мониторе и выбрать необходимую интенсивность тренировки.

{{% /steps %}}

{{< callout type="info" >}}
• Keep your breathing smooth and steady, breathing through your nose.
• Keep an eye on your heart rate during your workout. If it goes above your safe limit, slow down gradually (do it smoothly, not suddenly).
{{< /callout >}}
